{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05834","headline":"座上走笔赠薛璩慕容损 · 王维","name":"座上走笔赠薛璩慕容损","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"希世无高节，绝迹有卑栖。\n君徒视人文，吾固和天倪。\n缅然万物始，及与羣物齐。\n分地依后稷，用天信重黎。\n春风何豫人，令我思东溪。\n草色有佳意，花枝稍含荑。\n更待风景好，与君藉萋萋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05834.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05834","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}